Overall, remember that for splitting lines or words, the actual performance bottlenecks are typically not where you might initially suspect. File I/O and the efficiency of the data processing after splitting will generally have a more substantial impact on performance than the splitting operation itself. When in doubt, use a profiler to find out where your application's real bottlenecks lie.

